WEBVTT

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.516
Now Lizet was stuck as a potato.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.054
Her colleagues laughed
and went on with the meeting.

00:01:03.078 --> 00:01:06.446
Lizet didn't think much of it
until she got a text.

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:10.166
LO: Someone that's on my staff
took a picture of it

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:13.446
and posted it on her
personal Twitter account,

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:15.236
so I had no idea.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.756
AG: She wrote, "My boss
turned herself into a potato

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.756
and can't figure out how
to turn the setting off."

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.073
LO: And then my
colleagues' faces are hilarious

00:01:24.097 --> 00:01:26.536
because it looks like
they're trying to be serious,

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.896
but they're trying not to laugh
at the same time.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.793
AG: It is amazing because
you see her, you see the guy,